1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,130
Listen to an announcement in a classroom.

2
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:12,010
Students, I'd like to invite you to participate in a unique optional assignment.

3
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:19,266
We'll be conducting a field study at the local nature reserve next Friday, observing frogs

4
00:00:19,266 --> 00:00:26,040
and sampling water conditions to see if water pollution has an impact on frog behavior.

5
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:33,140
This is an excellent opportunity to apply what we've learned in class to a real world environment.

6
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:35,441
It's free to participate,

7
00:00:35,441 --> 00:00:38,165
but we can only have 30 students,

8
00:00:38,165 --> 00:00:42,000
so don't wait to sign up.
